<https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/study/idr0045/#experiment-protocol-1-1> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "Mouse embryos were collected from superovulated (injection of 7.5 international units (IU) pregnant mare serum followed by injection of 7.5 IU human chorionic gonadotropin 42 to 50 hours later) 8- to 24-week-old female mice according to the guidelines of EMBL Laboratory Animal Resources. Embryos were cultured in 30-mul drops of G1 medium (Vitrolife) covered by mineral oil (Ovoil, Vitrolife) with 5% CO2 and 5% O2 atmosphere." ;
