        <https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/study/idr0098/#experiment-protocol-1-2>,
        <https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/study/idr0098/#experiment-protocol-1-3>,
        <https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/study/idr0098/#experiment-protocol-1-4>,
        <https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/study/idr0098/#experiment-protocol-2-0>,
        <https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/study/idr0098/#experiment-protocol-2-1>,
