        <https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/study/idr0139/#screen-protocol-1-4>,
        <https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/study/idr0139/#screen-protocol-1-5>,
        <https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/study/idr0139/#screen-protocol-2-0>,
        <https://idr.openmicroscopy.org/study/idr0139/#screen-protocol-2-1>,
