    schema1:description "Endosymbiotic microalgae (Phaeocystis cordata, Haptophyta) within acantharian hosts collected from Mediterranean Sea surface waters. The symbiotic relationship involves morphological transformation of the algal cells, including multiplication of plastids, expansion of mitochondrial networks, and inhibition of cell division." ;
    schema1:name "_:Symbiotic Phaeocystis cordata within Acantharia host" ;
    schema1:taxonomicRange obo:NCBITaxon_280463,
        obo:NCBITaxon_33630 .

