    schema1:description "FIB-SEM observations were performed with a Zeiss Crossbeam 550 microscope. For 3D acquisition, the sample was abraded slice by slice in cross section with a Ga+ ion beam at 1.5 nA at 30 kV, and each freshly exposed surface was simultaneously imaged by SEM using 1 nA at 1.5 kV with the in-lens backscattered electron detector." ;
