<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1018#17a9d90f-3ea0-46e1-9fdc-20e9c8ca6f65> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "GFP was excited with a 488 nm laser and detected with a BP 495-575 + LP 750 beam splitter. Images were acquired with the C-Apochromat 63x/1.2 W Korr M27 (Zeiss) objective, pixel dwell time of 1.6 µs and frame size of 512x512. Pictures were processed with the manufacturer’s software ZEN lite (Zeiss)." ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Protein localization studies in roots of 5-d-old seedlings of Arabidopsis thaliana were performed with the widefield microscope ELYRA PS (Zeiss) equipped with a EMCCD camera at room temperature." ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000246 ;
    schema1:name "Arabidopsis thaliana Imaging" .

<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1018#2ed200cf-5ab4-4528-89f5-03e8517fa1f2> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "GFP was excited with a 488 nm laser and detected in the range of 491-553 nm. Z-stacks were acquired with the C-Apochromat 40x/1.20 W Korr M27 (Zeiss) objective, zoom factor of 8, pinhole set to 1,00 AU, pixel dwell time of 0.79 µs and frame size of 512x512 at room temperature. Z-stacks were processed with the manufacturer’s software ZEN lite (Zeiss) and ImageJ (National Institutes of Health). " ;
    schema1:labEquipment "For quantification a confocal laser scanning microscope LSM780 (Zeiss) was used. Imaging was controlled by the ZEN 2.3 SP1 FP3 (Black) (Zeiss) software." ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000251 ;
    schema1:name "Nicotiana benthamiana Quantification" .

