    schema1:description " All raw image sets were sequentially acquired by automated confocal feedback microscopy (ACFM; see PMID: 37909773, PMID: 24974044 for more information), using a 63x, 1.2 NA water objective on a CAM equipped Leica SP8 confocal running Matrix Screener, and identical acquisition parameters for all samples from a single experiment. Image acquisition parameters can be obtained in the xml file metadata folders associated with each image set." ;
