    schema1:description """Images were generated using a Nikon Ti2-E microscope equipped with a Crest X-Light-V2 spinning disk confocal (Crest Optics), emission filters, 438/24 (DAPI), 511/20 (GFP), 560/25 (RFP), and 685/40 (Cy5), and Celeste Light Engine excitation lasers 405/477/546/638 nm used respectively (Lumencor), Piezo stage (Mad City Labs), and a Prime 95B 25mm CMOS camera (Photometrics) using a Plan Apo VC 100x/1.4 Oil (Nikon). The data was captured with NIS-Elements software (v. 5.41.01 build 1709, Nikon) and processed in Fiji/ImageJ2 (Schindelin et al, 2012). 
""" ;
