<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1092#3be81c51-ccc0-4d4b-8dbc-b92ec5e6fec8> a schema1:BioSample ;
    schema1:description "Time-lapse recording (62h) of co-cultures consisting of INA-6 and human mesenchymal stromal cells (hMSCs) at different densities (single dispersed or confluent hMSCs). INA-6 on disperse hMSCs show attachment of INA-6 on hMSC, homotypic aggregate growth and spontaneous detachments of INA-6 in the convective stream, modeling dissemination. INA-6 on confluent hMSCs show heterotypic attachment and growth of INA-6 on hMSC. Dividing INA-6 cells generate either two MSC-adhering (not moving), or one MSC-adhering + non-MSC-adhering daughter cells " ;
    schema1:name "Co-Culture of primary hMSCs and Myeloma Cell line INA-6" ;
    schema1:taxonomicRange obo:NCBITaxon_9606 .

