    schema1:labEquipment """RNAscope samples: Stained sections were imaged with a Perkin Elmer Opera Phenix High-Content Screening System, in confocal mode with 1 μm z-step size, using a 20x water-immersion objective (NA 0.16, 0.299 μm per pixel). Channels: DAPI (excitation 375 nm, emission 435–480 nm), Opal 520 (ex. 488 nm, em. 500–550 nm), Opal 570 (ex. 561 nm, em. 570–630 nm), Opal 650 (ex. 640 nm, em. 650–760 nm). 
Samples from Hospital Clinic Barcelona: Image acquisition was performed on a Nikon Ti microscope (Japan) using Nis-Elements Basic Research Software (version 5.30.05).
""" ;
