<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1217#bb1c2890-4c62-4f27-a5d3-7f770750b435> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description """Continuous wave lasers Coherent OBIS LX/LS at either 488 nm, 514 nm or 561nm wavelength (camera triggered)
Objective lens / immersion medium: Nikon NA 1.49 Apo TIRF 100× oil,  using Olympus Type F oil (n=1.518)
Irradiance at sample: 1-5 kW/cm^2 at 60 degree incidence
Emission filters: 580 nm longpass dichroic; 525/50 nm (or 550/25 nm) and 594/25 nm bandpass filters
Detector: Teledyne Photometrics Prime95B, 12-bit ‘Sensitivity’ gain
Exposure time: 10 ms, less commonly 2 ms or 20 ms
Frame rate: 80 fps, less commonly 217 or 44 fps.
""" ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Custom SlimVar widefield microscope (Leake lab, University of York)" ;
    schema1:name "SlimVar" .

