        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1218#78e59e52-801c-4985-9ac3-edb9595e3675>,
        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1218#85a8fae5-631c-44b6-888e-24ff6aa8ee04>,
