    schema1:datePublished "2024-06-17" ;
    schema1:description """2D EM images from cultured kidney cells for teaching mitochondria morphology in microscopy courses. 
Aim: Teach morphological details of cell organelles at subcellular resolution. Focus on mitochondria morphology under control and treated conditions (mitochondria swellings after Deferasirox treatment).
These images are part of the publication: “The iron chelator Deferasirox causes severe mitochondrial swelling without depolarization due to a specific effect on inner membrane permeability.”
https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-020-58386-9#Sec13
https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-020-58386-9

""" ;
