        <https://orcid.org/0009-0008-1259-4017> ;
    schema1:datePublished "2024-06-17" ;
    schema1:description """This is an image of a human tonsil collected on the Rarecyte Orion. This is a widefield spectral-unmixing microscope with a 20x (0.75) dry objective. The slide was stained with 15 antibodies, Hoechst, and autofluorescence was calculated (AF1) . The channels are:

01 Hoechst
02 AF1
03 CD31_Argo515
04 CD11c_Argo555L
05 CD68_Argo535
06 CD163_Argo580L
07 CD20_Argo660L
08 CD4_Argo572
09 CD8a_Argo602
10 CD45RO_Argo624
11 PD-L1_Argo662
12 FOXP3_Argo686
13 LAG3_Argo730
14 PD-1_Argo760
15 Ki-67_Argo784
16 CD45_Argo810 
17 S100_Argo845""" ;
    schema1:identifier "S-BIAD1236" ;
    schema1:keywords "immunofluorescence",
