    schema1:description "3-14 days after inoculation, leaves or leaf pieces were detached from plant, placed on slide using double-sided sticky tape, and imaged using 2.5x or 10x long-distance air, or 40x water-dipping lenses. Excitation/detection wavelengths were 488/499 – 530 nm for GFP/YFP, 561/587 – 626 nm for RFP and 405/453-499 nm for CFP/aniline blue, respectively." ;
