    schema1:description "Samples were then incubated with 80% glycerol in water (v/v) for 24 hours at room temperature with gentle shaking, then mounted on a glass microscope slide with a 0.5mm thick 3D-printed ring (Formlabs) to allow the tissue to remain in a pool of 80% glycerol during imaging." ;
