<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1294#5429a4d0-2d20-4388-b19d-8e6f990477b8> a schema1:BioSample ;
    schema1:description "Human umbilical vein endothelial cells (HUVECs). For immunofluorescence (IF), fixed cells were permeabilized in ice-cold 0.2% Triton-X in PBS for 5 minutes, then blocked with 10% goat serum (GS) in PBS for 15 minutes. Incubation with primary antibody (NF-κB p65 (D14E12) XP Rabbit mAb, cat. #8242, Cell Signaling Technologies) diluted 1:500 with 10% GS in PBS was performed for 1 h. Cells were washed twice with 0.002% NP-40 detergent solution in PBS for 5 minutes. Next, the secondary antibody (Goat anti-Rabbit IgG (H+L) labeled with Alexa Fluor 647 (Invitrogen, cat. #A21244, lot. #2836809) was diluted with 10% GS in PBS and added to the sample for 30 minutes. After two 5-minute washing steps in PBS, cells were incubated with 5 uM DAPI in PBS for 15 minutes and then washed three times in PBS. All steps were performed at room temperature. IF samples were stored in PBS at 4°C until imaging." ;
    schema1:name "02_IF_NFkB" ;
    schema1:taxonomicRange obo:NCBITaxon_9606 .

<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1294#7ebb73ac-cc18-460a-a17c-31417dbf2333> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description """Multicolor images were acquired for DAPI (λex = 405 nm, λem = 445±23 nm), ATTO 550 (λex = 561 nm, λem = 594±21.5 nm) and Alexa Fluor 647 (λex = 637 nm, λem = 685±23.5 nm). All images were recorded in Imaris format at 16-bit depth and with 1024x1024 pixels dimensions (pixel size: 0.217 μm) using an iXon Ultra 888 EM-CCD camera. Tiles were recorded as z-stack of 10 um thickness with a step size of 0.4 um (26 frames) and with 10% overlap. Samples were imaged in PBS.

Acquisition order and channel-gene combination:
- 637 nm for CXCL8, 405 nm for cell nuclei (DAPI) - all replicates
- 637 nm for SELE, 405 nm for cell nuclei (DAPI) - all replicates
- 561 nm for SAMD4A, 405 nm for cell nuclei (DAPI) - all replicates""" ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Samples were imaged using an Andor Dragonfly 505 spinning disk confocal unit equipped with a Nikon Ti2-E inverted microscope and a Plan Apo 60x/1.40 oil objective. " ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000246,
        obo:FBbi_00000251,
        obo:FBbi_00000253 ;
    schema1:name "padFISH for Bursting kinetics" .

