    schema1:description """Images were captured using Spinning-disk confocal microscopy (Nikon Eclipse Ti inverted microscope) equipped with Perfect Focus and controlled by NIS-Elements software (Nikon). Images were acquired through a 60× Plan Apo 1.40 NA objective (Nikon). Multicolor images were acquired sequentially.

