    schema1:description """exposure time: 20 ms
number of frames per tif file: 1000 (standard SPT measurements) or 60000 (CD86, CTLA4, CalR-HT7-KDEL) or 90000 (EGFR) (long-term SPT measurements)
excitation of SIR: 647 nm laser with an irradiation intensity of 0.4 kW/cm² or 0.06 kW/cm³ for long-term imaging of EGFR
excitation of JF585: 561 nm laser with an irradiation intensity of 0.5 kW/cm²
Image size: 256 x 256 px with 157 nm pixel size""" ;
