    schema1:datePublished "2025-09-26" ;
    schema1:description "We identified DIDO3 and RNAPII colocalization on kinetochores with two different anti-DIDO3 antibodies: one recognizing DIDO common amino terminus combined with RNAPII and autoimmune serum CREST; which recognizes a range of centromeric and kinetochore proteins (Moroi et al., 1980); and a specific anti-DIDO3 antibody together with anti-RNAPII. Also, overexpressed HA-tagged DIDO3 (HA-DIDO3) in WT MEF colocalized with active RNAPIIS2." ;
    schema1:identifier "S-BIAD1390" ;
    schema1:keywords "Confocal microscopy, DIDO, RNAPII" ;
    schema1:license "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/" ;
    schema1:name "DIDO colocalization studies with RNAPII and RNAPS2" ;
