        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1396#e0636f2d-8b6f-4154-8612-2ae8b03bcd24> ;
    schema1:datePublished "2024-10-07" ;
    schema1:description "This submission holds the raw data and processed images for a high-content live-cell multiplex screen. The screen is used for chemogenomic compound annotation, i.e. the evaluation of e.g. cytotoxic effects. This submission is about a set of >200 chemogenomic candidate compounds, tested in a pre-screen and a primary screen. Further information about the EUbOPEN project, from which this set and experiment originated can be found in the links section." ;
    schema1:identifier "S-BIAD1396" ;
    schema1:keywords "Multiplex, phenotypic screening, live cell, high-content" ;
    schema1:license "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/" ;
    schema1:name "High-Content Live-Cell Multiplex Screen for Chemogenomic Compound Annotation; EUbOPEN wave 5" ;
    schema1:publisher <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/bioimage-archive/> ;
