<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1478#3f868fab-e327-4bbe-9463-fd311a99313f> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "The images were captured in TIF format, with resolutions of 3024x3024 for smartphone images, 3088x2076 for Olympus DP23 images and 2560x1920 for images captured using the Leica M205c. Imaging settings were not standardized and thus varied between image collection projects in parameters not further recorded, e.g. exposure time or lighting conditions." ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Olympus SZ61 (Olympus, Tokyo, Japan) in conjunction with the Olympus DP23 camera (Olympus, Tokyo, Japan),  Leica M205c microscope (Leica Microsystems, Wetzlar, Germany),  iPhone SE 3rd generation (Apple Inc., Cupertino, USA) in combination with a macro-lens taken at 24x magnification (Apexel-24XMH, Apexel, Shenzhen, China). Refer to the file list for detailed information in the image capture device." ;
