<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1502#d23300e7-712e-47f4-aa13-c52f19821431> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "Images were captured as 14-bit 3-channel Z-stacks of 1920 × 1216 × 20-30 px in 0.059 × 0.059 × 0.240 μm/px scaling. DAPI (Ex. 370-410 nm/Em. 430-470 nm), FITC (Ex. 450-490 nm/Em. 500-550 nm) and Rhodamine (Ex. 538-562 nm/Em. 570-640 nm) filters were used, avoiding signal saturation whenever possible." ;
