<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1513#551bacb4-d21c-46bb-ade3-8964e2134b83> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description """Images were taken with either 20x, 40x or 63x objectives, at 1024x1024 px, using PMT or HyD detectors. All images were taken so that sensor saturation was never reached and keeping background noise to the minimum.
Image stacks were taken when needed by using the optimized parameters for the laser/objective pairing.""" ;
