<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1536#f95bcd77-6838-43a2-86fe-175e6682d71d> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "Live cell imaging was performed with an on-stage incubation (temperature and CO2) from OkoLab equipped with Crest X-Light V3 confocal scanning unit, Lumencor Celesta Light Engine and Andor Zyla-4.2P camera. Imaging was done with a 20x dry objective (NA 0.75). Image stacks were recorded every 1 hour or 15 minutes for up to 18-24 hours or 2 hours respectively in an OkoLab environmental chamber at 37 °C and 5% CO2. Where used, the cells were imaged with brightfield with an exposure time of 40 ms and lamp intensity of 10%. H2B-mCherry (where used) was imaged with a 561 nm laser at 8.72% laser power and an exposure of 1 s. SIRF biosensor was imaged with a 488 nm laser at 2.78% laser power and an exposure of 300 ms. Multipoint acquisition was controlled by NIS-Elements 5.1 software " ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Automated Nikon Eclipse Ti2 microscope" ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000246,
        obo:FBbi_00000249 ;
    schema1:name "CREST" .

<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1536#fc03e5fa-74df-48df-8d6b-143269dec80e> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "For figure 5, after adding treatments, plate was inserted in IncuCyte chamber and 3 images per well were acquired every 1 h for 22 h. Images were analyzed using IncuCyte analysis software module. Images were taken with 20x magnification and analysed in the Basic Analyzer mode quantifying the percentage of total green area (units in um2/image). Parameters of IncuCyte® analyses: Green channel, Segmentation Top-Hat, Radius 100 uM, Threshold 2.3 GCU, Edge Split Off, Cleanup, Hole Fill 0, Adjust Size 1 px. Filters: Mean Intensity Min 1.2 uM2; Integrated Intensity: Min 18 uM2/ Max 1200 uM2." ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Incucyte S3" ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000246,
        obo:FBbi_00000249 ;
    schema1:name "Incucyte S3" .

