    schema1:description "3D images of cells were captured as z stacks with 0.2 mm spacing between planes, spanning 12.2 mm in total. Live cells were imaged at 37 °C in phenol red-free DMEM with high glucose (Gibco) supplemented with 1× penicillin/streptomycin, 10% fetal bovine serum, 4 mM l-Glutamine, and 25 mM HEPES" ;
    schema1:labEquipment "3i Marianas system configured with a Yokogawa CSU-W spinning disk confocal microscope utilizing a 100x Zeiss objective, 405 nm (Hoechst) and 488 nm (mEGFP) laser lines, and Slidebook (RRID:SCR_014300) 6.0 (3i). " ;
