    schema1:description "Phase contrast images were acquired with a 500 ms exposure while HADA fluorescence was imaged with the DAPI filter set using 385 nm excitation at 40% power with an exposure of 1000 or 250 ms based on the 1 or 8 h of incubation time with HADA, respectively." ;
    schema1:labEquipment """Nikon Eclipse Ti inverted microscope

