    schema1:description "A Plan-Apochromat 20x objective with a 1x camera adapter was used in conjunction with a pco.edge 4.2 4MP camera. Images were captured at 20X objective magnification with a pixel size of 0.326 µm. Autofocus was performed across 5 focal planes using a step size of 5 µm, with focus limits disabled.  The images were compressed and saved in JPEG format with a quality factor of 80%. " ;
