    schema1:datePublished "2025-09-01" ;
    schema1:description "Two medio-lateral sagittal sections from PCW 6 and one lateral sagittal section from PCW 9.5 of the normal developing embryo whole head were analyzed using Xenium in situ gene expression analysis, with a probe set targeting 389 genes. Eight sections from seven meningiomas (six hyper-mitotic WHO grade 3 and one WHO grade 1) were also analyzed using the same probe set." ;
