    schema1:description "A Zeiss Axio Observer Z1 microscope was coupled to the Perkin Elmer UltraVIEW Vox spinning disk confocal microscopy system with an encoded ASI MS2000 motorized piezo stage equipped with Plan-Apochromat 10x/0.45 and 63x/1.20 objectives (Carl Zeiss microscopy). The 405-nm, 488-nm and 561-nm solid-state laser lines were paired with the 452W25, 510W20, and 588W21 Semrock emission filters to minimize crosstalk between different fluorophores. Images were acquired with the Volocity Acquisition suite 6.3 (Perkin Elmer)." ;
