    schema1:datePublished "2025-03-12" ;
    schema1:description """To test the predominant role of the non-vesicular route for retrograde transport in U-2 OS cells, we inhibited vesicular trafficking using Brefeldin A, which blocks COPI coat formation at Golgi membranes and Wortmannin, which broadly affects endosome formation and trafficking and quantified transport of SM(Y), PE(18:1/Y), PC(Y:16:0), PC(Y/20:4) using the lipid imaging pipeline.

Paper: Iglesias-Artola et al. Quantitative imaging of lipid transport in mammalian cells. Nature (2025). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-025-09432-x""" ;
    schema1:identifier "S-BIAD1695" ;
    schema1:keywords "U-2 OS",
        "lipid transport" ;
