    schema1:datePublished "2025-09-01" ;
    schema1:description "We performed spatial transcriptomics using Enhanced ELectric single-molecule Fluorescence in situ Hybridization (EEL-FISH) on human glioblastoma samples, one multi-region sample as well as standard resection samples for a total of 27 patient samples. Tissue sections adjacent to EEL-FISH section were used for Hematoxylin and Eosin stainings." ;
