    schema1:name "See-Chi Lee" .

<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1702#06aaf2b6-d320-4e83-a466-25170f5af9a0> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description """Zebra fish neuromasts are imaged across three developmental stages: 3, 6 and 6.5 days post-fertilization (dpf). The datasets were composed primarily of lateral line neuromasts resulting in a dataset with 292 total volumes (179 volumes from 3dpf, 57 from 6dpf and 56 from 6.5dpf) with ZYX shape (107, 2048, 2048) or (35.3µm, 237.6µm, 237.6µm).
""" ;
    schema1:labEquipment "ASI Rapid Automated Modular Microscope System (RAMM) with a Nikon PlanApo VC x63 1.2NA objective and an Andor ZYLA-4.2P-USB3-W-2V4 sCMOS camera" ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000243,
        obo:FBbi_00000246 ;
    schema1:name "Zebrafish neuromast (widefield)" .

