    schema1:description "Brightfield volumes of live cells were acquired on a wide-field fluorescence microscope with a 20x magnification, 0.55 NA objective. The images were sampled on a camera with 6.5 µm pixel size and 2048 by 2048 pixel sensor size, at 1 µm Z-steps. Time-lapse imaging was performed at a time interval of 1 hour, for a total of 17 hours." ;
