    schema1:description "This repository contains raw intravital microscopy movies used to analyze DMG behavior with the BEHAV3D Tumor Profiler workflow in Google Colab. The data files are in Imaris (.ims) format and have been cropped based on large-scale regions identified by mLSR3D and processed using the Imaris software (Oxford Instruments)." ;
