    schema1:description """Confocal imaging: Images were acquired at a resolution of 512×512 pixels, with a scanning speed of 400 Hz (bidirectional), an optical zoom of 0.75, and a z-step of 3 μm (voxel size: 1.8×1.8×3 μm). Line accumulation was set to 2, and frame average to 2. 
Light-sheet imaging: Images were acquired at a resolution of 2048x2048 pixels, with an optical zoom of 1 and a z-step of 4 µm (voxel size: 1.62x1.62x4 µm). Light sheet with a thickness was 3.91 µm.""" ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Leica TCS SP8 laser scanning confocal microscope equipped with a 16x/0.6 IMM CORR VISIR HC FLUOTAR objective (15506533, Leica)." ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000251 ;
