    schema1:datePublished "2025-10-09" ;
    schema1:description "Image dataset of immunofluorescence tile- and confocal microscopy images and their corresponding segmentations of dorsal root ganglia (DRG) after chronic construction injury (CCI) in the rat. We analyzed the DRG of male and female rats 1 week or 5 weeks after CCI from the ipsilateral (IL) and contralateral (CL) side and L4 and L5 spinal level. Image segmentation was performed with a DL-based method (deepflash2) and advanced thresholding. Provided are the raw images, the converted tiff images separated by each channel, and the predicted masks." ;
    schema1:identifier "S-BIAD1944" ;
    schema1:keywords " DRG",
        "CCI",
        "annotation",
        "deep learning",
        "rat",
        "segmentation",
        "tile-microscopy" ;
    schema1:license "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" ;
    schema1:name "Image data from: Sex-specific molecular and cellular phenotyping of dorsal root ganglia during ongoing pain resolution after chronic constriction injury in the rat" ;
    schema1:publisher <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/bioimage-archive/> ;
    schema1:size <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1944#1037e7dd-b10a-47a1-885c-1f3b2998ff1c>,
