<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD1961#1037e7dd-b10a-47a1-885c-1f3b2998ff1c> a <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/QuantitiveValue> ;
