    schema1:datePublished "2025-06-04" ;
    schema1:description "RASA2KO and WT TCR T cells co-cultured with A375 melanoma cell line. The A375 cells express RFP which has the highest intensity in the nucleus. The TCR T cells are engineered to target the NY-ESO-1 antigen that is expressed by the A375 cells. Each well is imaged once every 2hrs using the automated Incucyte Zoom live-cell imaging machine. Phase and red channels are collected for each image. Spatial resolution is 4.975 μm/pixel. Plate maps of RASA2KO vs WT titrations and E:T ratios can be found here: https://github.com/bee-hive/sflcba/tree/main. " ;
    schema1:identifier "S-BIAD2001" ;
    schema1:keywords "A375 cell line",
        "Live cell imaging",
        "T cells",
        "TCR T cells" ;
    schema1:license "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/" ;
    schema1:name "Live-cell analyses with unsegmented images to study cancer cell response to modified T cell therapy" ;
    schema1:publisher <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/bioimage-archive/> ;
    schema1:size <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2001#1037e7dd-b10a-47a1-885c-1f3b2998ff1c>,
