<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2027#49f263ec-51c4-4dde-9282-26e5fa5adb05> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "Slides were inserted into the Hyperion XTi Imaging System and photographed to aid region selection (Panorama, see panoramas_list.xlsx for more details). ROIs of ~1 mm2 were selected and laser-ablated at 200-Hz frequency at 1 μm/pixel resolution on the IMC instrument (see antibody_list.xlsx for details on the antibody panel and associated channels and annotations_list.xlsx for details on ROIs). ROIs were selected based on pathologist-guided annotations of tissues (tumour or immune/stroma of pathological interest/importance)." ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Standard BioTools Hyperion XTi" ;
    schema1:name "Image acquisition 2" .

