    schema1:description "Gels were cut to an appropriate size to fit the Ibidi chambers and added onto the wells. The gels were overlaid with water to prevent drying or shrinkage during imaging. The gels were imaged using the Zeiss LSM 880 with the Airy fast mode using a Plan-Apochromat 63×/1.4 Oil DIC M27. The images were processed with the default 3D airyscan processing on the ZEN software prior to further analysis." ;
    schema1:labEquipment "LSM 880" ;
    schema1:name "Image acquisition of immune-labelled U-ExM gels" .

