        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2088#4ee0b78e-57c8-4c9a-9f74-073403d7dc7f>,
        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2088#6c989df0-edec-45a6-9705-5f6304e2c2f6>,
