    schema1:description "Hamamatsu ORCA-Flash 4.0 camera, a 100X objective (Nikon, OFN Ph3 DM, N.A. 1.45) and a Spectra X light engine (Lumencor). The following Chroma filter sets were used to acquire fluorescence images: DAPI (excitation ET350/50x, dichroic T400lp, emission ET460/50 m), GFP (excitation ET470/40x, dichroic T425lpxr, emission ET525/50 m) and mCherry/TexasRed (excitation ET560/40x, dichroic T585lpxr, emission ET630/75 m). Temperature was maintained at 30°C using a customized enclosure and temperature controller (Air-Therm SWT, World Precision Instrument) for timelapse imaging. " ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Nikon Ti Eclipse" ;
    schema1:name "Snapshots of transition phase E. coli with different cytoplasmic GFPs with different net charges " .

