    schema1:description "Images were taken with 16-bit depth and at a nominal resolution of 1.866 μm per voxel on the x and y axes. In the z dimension, we took sectional images in 2-μm steps." ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Wide-field fluorescence imaging was performed on a Keyence BZ-X810 using Chroma ET-mCh/TR and  ET-CY5 NX filter cubes. Images were stitched using Keyence BZ-X810 Analyzer software and compressed and adjusted using ImageJ. " ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000246 ;
    schema1:name "Image acquisition - dopaminergic neuron image" .

