<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2122#74a07137-3380-4b72-8528-1be285aee318> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description """HC PL APO CS2 63x/1.4 oil-immersion objective for colocalization studies.
HC PL APO CS2 40x/1.3 oil-immersion objective for centrosome orientation and quantification studies.
3D volume stacks were taken sequentially (in a frame-by-frame acquisition mode, 400 Hz, 1024x1024 pixel image format, system-optimized Z-step size to achieve a voxel size of 0.2841x0.2841x0.3462 μm3) using 405 nm (DAPI), 490 nm (Alexa 488) and 633 nm (Alexa 647) excitation lines with three independent hybrid detectors (HyDs).""" ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Leica Stellaris 5 confocal microscope using the LAS X software equipped with a 405 diode laser, an OPSL 488, a DPSS 561 and a white Light laser, WLL (485-685 nm) with a 80MHz repetition rate, equipped with silicon based hybrid (HyD S) detectors" ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000251 ;
    schema1:name "Leica Stellaris 5 confocal microscope " .

