        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2130#d1a3423b-3170-4a2d-9e1a-ca370a33d2a6>,
        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2130#d629f9be-c2d2-4d80-8396-ef2cae315f77>,
        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2130#d8cce63f-81c9-48e3-8853-8d74f3457387>,
        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2130#e1f92e3c-c3b4-4130-8d54-f0e19e3aeede>,
