<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2132#9d3a1f86-e480-4c5a-be9d-bcfcaeaa5703> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "Three fluorescent oligoreporters with spectrally distinct dyes (Atto550 , AF647,  AF750) were applied to the tissue in iterative imaging cycles. The images were captured using a widefield microscope with a Olympus UCPlanFL 20×/0.70 NA objective and a resolution of 0.5 µm/pixel." ;
    schema1:labEquipment "PhenoImager Fusion 2.2.0 (Akoya Bio- sciences, Marlborough, MA)." ;
