<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2238#1e86406b-2b78-4c6b-a720-623ec65efe19> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "Images were taken using the following laser scanning confocal microscopes: Leica SP8 STED, Zeiss LSM710, Zeiss LSM980 Airyscan2. Images were analyzed using ImageJ (NIH)-Fuji and Photoshop. For quantification of the fraction of NEUN+ or different glial subtypes in EGFP+ glial cells, cell number in the whole cortex of one hemisphere of coronal section was counted." ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Leica SP8 STED, Zeiss LSM710, Zeiss LSM980 Airyscan2" ;
