    schema1:description "GFP tagged proteins were excited with 488 nm and their emission detected with 400-550nm, mRFP tagged proteins were excited with 555 nm and detected with 525-720nm, and DAPI was excited with 647 nm and detected with 400-505nm. A single image per cell was acquired around the middle plan of the cell with the following airyscan settings: dual time of 1.15 μs and a size of 0.31 μm. Airyscan image processing was applied automatically after imaging using Zeiss ZEN software (version blue 3.6) to obtain the final processed images. " ;
