    schema1:description """NIH3T3 fibroblast cells stably expressing the WT TPR protein that can bind to the nuclear pores. Over-expression of TPR-GFP or TPRdeltaMid-GFP or TPRdeltaMid::FG(NUP98)-GFP for 48h after addition of doxycycline. 
IF of endogenous TPR (Nuclear Basket) and endogenous Nup153 (Nuclear pores complex) after overexpression.""" ;
