    schema1:description "The parent study primarily entails the use of TurboID proximity-labeling proteomics to map the interactomes and localization of the tyrosine phosphatase SHP2, and some of its pathogenic mutations. This BioImage Archive contains fluorescence microscopy data on cells expressing SHP2, used to further analyze and corroborate the proteomics data." ;
