<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2269#da9051d5-3650-4be7-8688-f04878bd744b> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description """Imaging was performed using a Nikon Ti-E Spinning Disk microscope with 100x objective and 1.5x tube lens. Fluorescence was excited with a 488 nm laser and emission light was filtered using a dual band filter 433/530 HC. An Andor Ixon Ultra 888 EMCCD camera was used for detection.
Channel 1 - content: Cellular autofluorescence; Channel 1 - biological entity: S. coelicolor hyphae
Z-stacks of confocal images with 0.2 µm step size, maximum intensity projection of individual z-stacks
Dimension extents: x: 1024 y: 1024 z: 28 px
Size description: x: 63.12 y: 63.12 z: 5.6 µm
Pixel/voxel size description: x: 86 y: 86 z: 200 nm""" ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Nikon Ti-E Spinning Disk " ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000253 ;
    schema1:name "July Image 2025 Image Acquisition" .

<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2269#dc1955f8-e10f-4573-9c9f-2c174168663c> a schema1:BioSample ;
    schema1:description """.. Comparison of spatial transcriptomics technologies for medulloblastoma cryosection.
The image is a visualization showing the integration of multimodal data including a spinning disk confocal image and gene expression data from a spatial transcriptomic experiment on a human medulloblastoma sample. The microscopy image of the tissue with the nuclei in white has been overlayed with the result of the cell segmentation colored according to the assigned cell type (immune cells: red, stromal cells: violet, brain cells: cyan/blue, tumor cells: green). A subset of transcripts for three genes whose expression varies across the different cell types in the tissue have been represented as colored dots (CD4 (immune cells): red, PTCH1 (tumor cells): green, AQP4 (brain cells): blue).""" ;
    schema1:name "Cover Image 2025 Biosample" ;
    schema1:taxonomicRange obo:NCBITaxon_9606 .

<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2269#e7da1cca-af16-4456-b2b3-1565276c197d> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description """Detected secondary electrons
Channel 1 - content: Jurkat cell line E6.1 (artificial color table, cyan); Channel 1 - biological entity: Surface of Jurkat cells
Channel 2 - content: Raji B cell lymphoma cell line (artificial color table, yellow); Channel 2 - biological entity: Surface of a Raji B cell.
Parameters: 10 keV
Magnification: 6500x
Scale bar: 2 µm""" ;
    schema1:labEquipment "FEI XL30 FEG ESEM" ;
    schema1:name "September Image 2025 Image Acquisition" .

