<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2273#3324d6d8-6bca-4f82-a11a-39aad8fc9413> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description """The multiplex antibody panel scanning was performed on PhenoImager HT 2.0 (Akoya Biosciences) with the acquisition software PhenoImagerHT 2.0.0. Imaging was done with the resolution 0.5um/pixel (20x).
A spectral fluorophore was used for each primary antibody and a synthetic library combined with extraction of tissue-specific autofluorescence spectrum was prepared using the InForm software (version 3.0, Akoya Biosciences) to enable optimal multispectral unmixing. 
The exposure times were as follows: DAPI (1.8ms), Opal 570 (42.27ms), Opal 480 (14.11ms), Opal 620 (29.15ms), Opal 780 (54.26ms), Opal 520 (116.93ms), sample AF (100ms).
All samples being compared were processed in parallel and images were acquired using the same settings.""" ;
    schema1:labEquipment """PhenoImager HT 2.0 (Akoya Biosciences) 
""" ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000246 ;
    schema1:name "Scan 1" .

