    schema1:datePublished "2025-09-09" ;
    schema1:description "Time-lapse epifluorescence microscopy of MCF10A cells stably expressing OptoFGFR1-mCitrine, ERK-KTR-mKate2 and H2B-iRFP713. Cells received single, brief blue-light pulses at 7 different doses, repeated 20× (main dataset) or 15× (second dataset) at 30-min intervals, to quantify information transmission from receptor to ERK at the single-cell level. Data include ERK cytosol to nucleus ratio trajectories and derived features used for SLEMI-based mutual information analysis." ;
