    schema1:description "Channels: ERK-KTR-mKate2 (exc. 560 nm); H2B-iRFP (exc. 640 nm); typical exposure 200 ms each; frame interval 2 min. Optogenetic activation: 491 nm (blue) laser; 7 doses by illumination time: 200, 300, 500, 700, 1000, 1500, 2000 ms at ~200 µW; 30 min between pulses; routines repeated 20× (main) / 15× (second dataset); total imaging ~93.6 h and ~81.6 h. Input power concurrently recorded (ThorLabs PM100D), variability ~10–20%" ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Olympus IX83 inverted microscope; Photometrics Evolve EMCCD; Gataca Systems laser bench; objective 20× air, NA 0.7; stage-top incubator (Pecon CO₂-Controller 2000; TempControl 37-2). Control via iLas2 and MetaMorph" ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000246 ;
    schema1:name "Epifluorescence time-lapse with optogenetic stimulation" .

