    schema1:description "To profile the non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) tumor microenvironment and underlying gene expression of tumor, stromal and immune cells we designed an in situ sequencing (ISS) target gene panel (n = 242) with the company Cartana, which is now part of 10x Genomics, capturing relevant cell type markers and genes previously reported to be involved in disease onset, progression and therapy resistance. We imaged n = 7 commercial adenocarcinoma samples using six rounds of imaging." ;
