<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2306#81895c50-85b1-4e5f-9492-ca8d21b42f80> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description """Immunofluorescence
Cells were imaged on EVOS M7000 widefield microscope equipped with a UPlanSApo 20x/0.75 N.A. objective lens, DAPI, GFP, and Cy5 EVOSTM Light Cubes and a CMOS camera. Images were analysed using CellProfiler (46) to measure mean intensity grey values in the nucleus of cells. Experiments were repeated a minimum of two times.  

Western blotting
Western blots were visualised using the Odyssey CLx Imager (LI-COR Biosciences). Quantification was performed using the Odyssey Image Studio Lite® software v.5.2 (LI-COR Biosciences).
""" ;
    schema1:labEquipment """Evos7000
Odyssey CLx Imager""" ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000246 ;
    schema1:name "Image acqusition" .

