<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2315#62d4a1e2-b47d-414e-a548-37907a59dab3> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "Imaging was conducted using a Zeiss Axioscan 7 slide scanner equipped with the Colibri 7 LED light source and an EC Plan-Neofluar 20x/0.50 M27 objective at 2×2 binning. Stitching of the raw images was performed using ZEN software (version 3.5, Blue Edition), with the DAPI channel set as the reference for all channels and the following parameters: minimal overlap of 5%, maximal shift of 15%, Comparer set to Optimized, and Global Optimizer set to Best." ;
