<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2326#480bb0bc-db43-46e5-88ae-071380b9d63c> a <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/QuantitiveValue> ;
