    schema1:description "Human triple negative breast cancer tissue samples including cores and resections from Neoadjuvant Chemotherapy (NACT) responders and non-responders. Samples were acquired as part of the Wellcome Leap DeltaTissue project and were stained with the nuclear dye SiR-DNA followed by imaging using FLIM to detect chromatin compaction" ;
