        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2491#34399d35-1ae1-4344-8665-ed4cf0d9364c>,
        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2491#4eedb666-264c-4945-a480-30a25ccfc04e>,
        <https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2491#55fedc4a-f3e9-4c85-a146-050df8a45ebf>,
