    schema1:description "Raw two-channel TIRF microscopy images (488 nm and 640 nm) generated for particle detection and ROI-based colocalization analysis. The dataset includes experimental and control image sets acquired under identical imaging conditions. Images were analyzed using custom ImageJ (Fiji) macros to identify particles in each channel and quantify spatial co-occurrence based on ROI overlap." ;
