<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2529#aba13ea6-99f5-48df-9b6e-5319778a7b42> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "For scDVP, confocal image acquisition was performed using a PerkinElmer OperaPhenix high-content imaging system equipped with a 20× air objective (numerical aperture 0.8). The system was operated through Harmony software version 4.9, with images collected using 2×2 binning and 10% overlap between adjacent tiles. For each sample, a single focal plane was manually selected and maintained across all channels. To eliminate channel crosstalk, fluorophores were excited sequentially, with the following acquisition parameters: CFP at 80% laser power and 100ms exposure, Alexa 488 at 30% power and 20ms exposure, Alexa 568 at 80% power for 40ms, and Alexa 647 at 60% power for 40ms. " ;
    schema1:labEquipment "PerkinElmer OperaPhenix high-content imaging system equipped with a 20× air objective " ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000253 ;
    schema1:name "scDVP image acquisition " .

