<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2534#dfe4813d-b957-4e6b-b641-d7c4a5e7c18d> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "Tilt-series (tilt range ± 60°; 1° angular increments) were acquired at ×30,000 magnifications using SerialEM (Mastronarde, 2005). Tomographic reconstructions were generated using weighted back-projection with etomo (Kremer et al., 1996)." ;
