<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD2535#3c4e4aec-73db-47a7-97e7-eb6d4bd71284> a schema1:BioSample ;
    schema1:description """This dataset contains light microscopy images of CD34⁺ hematopoietic stem and progenitor cells undergoing erythroid differentiation. Images were acquired at day 3 and day 6 of differentiation from unedited control samples and genome-edited samples. Cells were stained using May–Grünwald–Giemsa staining to enable morphological assessment of erythroid maturation.

Microscopy images were used to evaluate cellular morphology and differentiation status at each time point. Cells were manually counted and classified according to differentiation stage based on established morphological criteria, allowing quantitative assessment of erythroid progression between unedited and edited conditions.""" ;
    schema1:name "Microscopy images of differentiated CD34+ cells (DAY 3 and DAY 6) of unedited and edited samples " ;
    schema1:taxonomicRange obo:NCBITaxon_9606 .

