    schema1:taxonomicRange obo:NCBITaxon_9606 .

<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD807#b58906ca-a2ef-4b77-b70e-195d477a7da1> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "Using a 10x magnification setting on the Olympus FV3000, a 100x oil-objective lens was used. The 488 nm laser was used to image nuclei and mtDNA (PicoGreen), and the 561 nm laser was used to image the ILV formation (Tsg101-mCherry), both at 5% laser power. The images were obtained with line scanning of 512 x 512 pixels." ;
    schema1:labEquipment "The co-localization of cytosolic leakage of mtDNA and TSG101 was visualized by confocal microscopy (Olympus, FV3000)." ;
    schema1:measurementTechnique obo:FBbi_00000251 ;
    schema1:name "confocal microscopy" .

