    schema1:description "The region of interest was selected based on the DAPI signal and 50 z-slices were acquired with a step size of 0.4 μm (20 μm z-range) per field of view (FOV). Lasers and filters were set to match fluorescent properties of DAPI and the other dyes. Tiles were imaged with a 10% overlap to ensure accurate stitching." ;
