<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD832#bc651c6d-f6ea-4341-bfbd-6ce43849eeca> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description """HE and IHC slides were scanned at 20x or 40x with a slidescanner for brightfield. 
Immune fluorescent images were acquired at 40x, 60x and 192x as individual images or z-stacks. Acquisition parameters were adapted according to the fluorescent intensities. 
Scanning electron microscopy and transmission electron microscopy were performed as described in the publication.""" ;
