<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD851#8bf94d42-da76-42cd-8b31-3ff63ecabed4> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "We recorded 9 sites per well at 20x magnification in 5 fluorescent channels, DAPI (387/447 nm), GFP (472/520 nm), Cy3 (531/593 nm), TexasRed (562/642 nm), Cy5 (628/692 nm). The first site of each well was used for laser_based auto_focus in the DAPI channel." ;
