    schema1:description "3D images of cells were captured as z stacks with 0.2 mm spacing between planes, spanning 12.2 mm in total. Live HeLa cells were imaged at 37°C in phenol red-free DMEM with high glucose (Gibco) supplemented with 1X penicillin/streptomycin, 10% fetal bovine serum, 4 mM L-Glutamine, and 25 mM HEPES. " ;
