<https://www.ebi.ac.uk/biostudies/bioimages/studies/S-BIAD987#7a491fef-6c24-46cb-823b-dad79b1814ff> a schema1:LabProtocol ;
    schema1:description "FACS-collected P. falciparum parasites retained MitoTracker Deep Red and Hoechst 33342 staining for visualization of the mitochondrion and nucleus, respectively, using the 633 and 405 laser lines. The 488 laser line was used to visualize Super Folder Green fluorescence localized to the apicoplast. Erythrocytes infected with parasites displaying MitoTracker and Hoechst signal were selected at random and viewed at 10x zoom factor for scan area of 13.5 µm x 13.5 µm. Z-stacks of fluorescence signals were acquired using the Frame scanning function for all three channels accompanied by Airyscan processing. " ;
    schema1:labEquipment "Zeiss 880 LSM with Airyscan equipped with a Zeiss plan apochromat 63x/1.4 NA oil immersion objective." ;
    schema1:name "Airyscan image acquisition " .

